真讽刺 那你还不赶紧[与俄国人音似]去做汤
That's funny because you're not rushin' to make my soup.

227
00:09:52,020 --> 00:09:53,900
不 不 我在开玩笑呢
No, no, no, no. I'm kidding you, man.

228
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:56,020
