想都别想
No way.

266
00:11:31,420 --> 00:11:33,380
住的地方离下水道已经够接近
I'm living so close to the gutter as it is.

267
00:11:33,380 --> 00:11:34,720
再矮下去还得了
I can't risk being any shorter.

268
00:11:35,740 --> 00:11:37,060
我们就跟达叔约在这里
Here's where we're meeting Darius.

269
00:11:37,220 --> 00:11:38,200
"最炫地铁风"
"Subway style".

270
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:40,460
每次我经过这个地方 我都在想
Every time I walk by this place I wonder

271
