有何能为两位美女效劳的吗
What can I help you dolls with?

281
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:06,040
我们是来跟朋友碰面的
Actually, we're just here meeting a friend.

282
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:07,560
来帮忙他选衣服
We're going to help him pick out a shirt.

283
