先告诉你们 如果嫌太贵
Now, listen, if the price is too high,

286
00:12:14,620 --> 00:12:16,880
你可以跟我来"讲讲价"
you and I can, uh, negotiate.

287
00:12:18,340 --> 00:12:19,140
你也行啦
Or you.

288
00:12:21,340 --> 00:12:23,740
我不敢相信我们要用辛苦赚的小费
I still can't believe we're using our tip money

289
