你这段子有点太过了
That material feels a little funky.

302
00:12:52,740 --> 00:12:54,940
你在丰田汽车遇见的人能接受
I mean, that kind of humor might have worked over at Toyota--

303
00:12:54,940 --> 00:12:56,180
-我是在克莱斯勒 -随便啦
- It's Chrysler. - Whatever.

304
00:12:56,780 --> 00:12:58,160
但你现在来到了纽约
But this is New York.

305
00:12:58,320 --> 00:13:01,220
这里有很多的同性恋 或者金发人士
there are a lot of people, be them gays, or blondes,

306
