又来了 你看 就是这类的...
Again, see? That's the kind of stuff...

314
00:13:18,220 --> 00:13:19,840
卡洛琳 大家就爱听重口过火的
Caroline, come on. It's so wrong it's right.

315
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,240
这些是我今晚要讲的段子
Look, I have the jokes right here.

316
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:25,120
先让你们"试驾"一下 看看反应如何
Let's take them on a little test drive and see how they do.

317
00:13:25,280 --> 00:13:26,878
来吧 站后退点哦 女士们
All right? So back it up, ladies.

318
00:13:26,878 --> 00:13:29,547
