You going to need some laughing room.

319
00:13:29,547 --> 00:13:31,946
肯定会很好笑吧
this is going to be hilarious.

320
00:13:32,800 --> 00:13:34,560
在场有人开斯玛特吗
Anybody here have a smart car?

321
