站过来就感到笑气逼人了 对吧 卡洛琳
Yeah, that feels funnier already, right Caroline?

327
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:54,840
好的
All right.

328
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:57,480
你们知道什么人不开斯玛特吗
You know who doesn't drive a smart car?

329
