340
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:33,060
请容在下给你们推荐这西装外套吧
but can I interest you in a nice suit?

341
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:35,360
瞧这件 多经典
Look at this one. It's a classic.

342
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:38,200
地面上开的店可不卖这颜色哦
You can't get this color above ground.

343
00:14:39,620 --> 00:14:42,220
就是这个 达叔需要一套西装
That's it. Darius needs a suit.

344
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:44,560
专业的单口相声员都穿西装
All the professional comedians wear suits,

345
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:45,700
而且你也说了
and like you said,

346
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:47,780
做什么工
you have to dress for the job you want.

347
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:49,360
而他的烂段子
And with jokes like that,

348
00:14:49,380 --> 00:14:51,560
得靠最搞笑的西装才能救
he needs the funniest suit they have.

349
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:54,920
你们有辛巴达系列的西装吗
Do you have anything from the Sinbad collection?

350
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:56,540
有的
I do.

351
00:14:58,980 --> 00:15:01,140
麦克斯 光靠搞笑西装救不起吧
Max, I don't think the suit's gonna be enough.

352
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:02,880
我觉得还得再加点东西
I think he needs something else,

353
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:04,700
比如搭配一个布偶
you know, like, a puppet.

354
00:15:05,580 --> 00:15:06,720
布偶吗
A puppet?

355
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:09,160
够蠢够好笑 就是这个了
That's exactly what he needs.

356
00:15:16,740 --> 00:15:19,000
我昨晚跟个男人出去约会
I went out with a guy last night.

357
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:21,360
他问我能不能各付各的[荷兰式]
Asked me if we could go dutch.

358
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:24,840
我说 "不知道呢
I said, "I don't know."

359
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:26,640
我不会说荷兰语的你个小气废柴"
"what's Dutch for cheap-ass bitch?"

360
00:15:29,654 --> 00:15:31,940
把他一脚踹飞啦
You kick him to the curb!

361
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,620
稍后继续
We'll be right back,

362
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:36,360
老娘要先去休息了
because mama's gotta go put her feet up.

363
00:15:37,460 --> 00:15:38,200
小姐
Uh, miss?

364
00:15:38,500 --> 00:15:40,160
等你忙完了能给我们再上一轮酒吗
Can we get another round when you get a chance?

365
00:15:40,220 --> 00:15:40,740
再一轮吗
Another round?

366
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:43,260
我们没喝到瞎了之前 酒都别停
And keep them coming until we can no longer see.

367
00:15:43,900 --> 00:15:45,000
都算我卡上吧
Put it on my card.

368
00:15:45,280 --> 00:15:46,100
没问题
You got it.

369
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:47,800
这句话 怎么说都还是爽
Man, that feels good every time.

370
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:50,660
麦克斯 别以为
Hey, Max. Just because

371
00:15:50,660 --> 00:15:51,880
你请我喝酒
you're buying me drinks

372
00:15:51,880 --> 00:15:53,600
我就会无节操的对你投怀送抱
doesn't mean I'm going to put out.

373
00:15:55,580 --> 00:15:59,000
这根芹菜就是我在相声社的麦克风
My celery stick is my microphone at the comedy club!

374
00:16:00,680 --> 00:16:02,140
我来了 我来了
I'm here, I'm here.

375
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:04,580
有买到布偶吗
Did you get the puppet?

376
00:16:04,980 --> 00:16:06,300
姐出马 当然是办妥了
Oh, I've got the puppet.

377
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:16,260
请进
Hey, come on in.

378
00:16:18,100 --> 00:16:19,800
姑娘们 你们好吗
Hey, girls. How you doing?

379
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:22,100
笑星达叔打了鸡血了呢
Darius the hilarious is pumped.

380
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:24,140
状态超好 准备笑力全开
I'm totally in my zone right now.

381
00:16:24,140 --> 00:16:26,267
配这西装 笑死人不偿命啊
And I can't miss in this suit.

382
00:16:26,267 --> 00:16:29,500
这个嘛...
Well...

383
00:16:29,500 --> 00:16:31,880
达叔 我们就是来跟你谈这事的
Darius, that's what we wanted to talk to you about.

384
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:33,620
-我们都是你的支持者 -铁杆粉丝
- You know we're big fans. - Big, big fans.

385
00:16:33,660 --> 00:16:35,040
你人超好 段子超好笑
You're amazing, your act's incredible.

386
00:16:35,357 --> 00:16:36,780
传说中的笑星达叔
you are Darius the hilarious.

387
00:16:36,780 --> 00:16:38,560
我们都爱你的斯玛特段子
Max and I love the smart car stuff.

388
00:16:38,660 --> 00:16:40,340
笑星之名 绝非虚传
It's hilarious, per your name.

389
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:42,360
但在纽约这小破村
But, well, it is New York.

390
00:16:42,420 --> 00:16:44,180
很多人不聪明 也没车
not a lot of people are smart, or have cars.

391
00:16:44,560 --> 00:16:45,260
纽约嘛 你懂得
Yeah, you know New York.

392
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:46,580
完全不在时尚的尖端
not exactly the cutting edge.

393
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:49,060
下午跟你分开之后 我们俩有了个主意
So, after Max and I left you, we had a thought.

394
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:49,860
我们给你买了个布偶
We got you a puppet.

395
00:16:51,500 --> 00:16:53,300
没错 我是有点喝高了
And, yes, I was stoned.

396
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:55,680
但卡洛琳看了也笑个不停哦
But Caroline was laughing just as hard as me.

397
00:16:57,380 --> 00:16:58,300
你们买了什么给我
You got me a what?

398
00:16:58,520 --> 00:17:00,160
布偶 买了个布偶给你
A puppet. We got you a puppet.

399
00:17:00,500 --> 00:17:01,900
我从不用布偶的啊
But I don't use a puppet.

400
00:17:02,340 --> 00:17:03,800
用过一次就知道啦
Until you do.

401
00:17:04,580 --> 00:17:06,520
想象一下 你说完个段子
Just imagine, at the end of your act

402
00:17:06,520 --> 00:17:08,060
-或段子开头 -甚至是整个段子中
- or in the beginning... - Or all the way through.

403
00:17:08,300 --> 00:17:10,920
先生女士们 笑星达叔
Ladies and gentlemen, Darius the hilarious

404
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:14,160
与他的搭档 贾斯汀·逼勃
and his partner, Justin Beaver!

405
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:19,460
"哇靠 女孩 哇靠啊[水坝]"
"Damn, girl. And I mean dam."

406
00:17:20,100 --> 00:17:22,380
"我盖了一个水坝哦"
"As in, I built one."

407
00:17:24,360 --> 00:17:26,380
你就算不好笑也无所谓
And you don't even have to be funny because

408
00:17:26,380 --> 00:17:28,220
贾斯汀·逼勃就已经够好笑了
Justin Beaver does the work for you.

409
00:17:28,280 --> 00:17:29,100
你也来一次 麦克斯
Show him, Max.

410
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:32,640
"我是直男"
"I'm straight".

411
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,800
你不笑不行啊
You gotta laugh!

412
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:38,900
是咩
Do I?

413
00:17:40,740 --> 00:17:42,000
真的该笑吗
I mean, honestly?

414
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:44,440
取笑他的性向吗
Making fun of Justin Beaver's sexuality?

415
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:45,900
这过火了吧
I find that a tad offensive.

416
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:55,300
下一段演出 由来自汽车之城的表演者
This next act comes to us from the Motor city.

417
00:17:55,700 --> 00:17:58,960
大家请掌声欢迎 笑星达叔
Please give it up for Mr. Darius the hilarious.

418
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:05,920
台下的观众今晚好吗
All right. How's everybody doing tonight?

419
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:09,160
台下的观众有人开斯玛特吗
Who out there has a smart car?

420
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:12,440
开"半台车"在街上溜达 车主肯定不聪明
Because I don't think it's smart to drive a half a car.

421
00:18:13,020 --> 00:18:14,100
这不笑不行啊
You gotta laugh.

422
00:18:17,560 --> 00:18:20,700
惨了 我逼真的假笑用完了
Oh, no. I ran out of fake laughter.

423
00:18:22,220 --> 00:18:23,840
拜托哦 斯玛特
Yeah, I mean, smart car.

424
00:18:23,900 --> 00:18:25,080
你们看过这种车吗
Have you seen this thing?

425
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:27,680
这车就像个背包一样的大小
It's like you driving around in a backpack.

426
00:18:30,300 --> 00:18:32,140
这不笑不行啊
You gotta laugh.

427
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:33,160
是咩
Do we?

428
00:18:33,660 --> 00:18:36,140
你叫斯玛特帮你编段子可能还好笑些
Why don't we have a smart car write some jokes for you?

429
00:18:38,760 --> 00:18:41,520
你替斯玛特辩护我也能理解啦
Yeah, well, I can see why you would defend the smart car.

430
00:18:41,740 --> 00:18:43,960
只有这种车你的小短腿才够得着踏板
It's the only car your feet can reach the pedals in.

431
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:51,520
说得好对啊 他真的很矮
Yeah, but that's so true. He's very short!

432
00:18:54,040 --> 00:18:56,980
车也矮小 非常合理啊
As is the car. It all lines up.

433
00:18:58,358 --> 00:19:00,760
大家快看这个灰发老鬼
Look at this gray-haired scrub, man.

434
00:19:00,760 --> 00:19:02,360
原来黑人还会显老
Apparently black do crack.

435
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:05,700
唐金都打电话来了
Hey, Don Kng called.

436
00:19:05,740 --> 00:19:07,360
叫你把他的头还给他
Said he want his whole head back.

437
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:12,280
麦克斯 你看 厄尔好以儿为傲
Max, look. Look how proud Earl is.

438
00:19:12,900 --> 00:19:13,700
喂喂 金发妞
Hey, hey, hey, blondie.

439
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:15,620
能等我表演完了再说话吗
You mind not talking until I finish?

440
00:19:15,860 --> 00:19:17,520
等等 估计你脑子里也只在想着
Wait, a minute. You're probably just thinking,

441
00:19:17,780 --> 00:19:22,080
"我的老天 美鞋 美鞋 梳子 美鞋"
"Oh, my god. Shoes, shoes, hairbrush, shoes."

442
00:19:22,860 --> 00:19:24,360
我的老天啊
Oh, my God.

443
00:19:24,360 --> 00:19:26,600
我刚的确是在想美鞋呢
I actually was thinking about shoes!

444
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:30,720
抱歉 您的卡有点问题
I'm sorry, there's a problem with your card.

445
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:31,900
显示支付失败
It's been declined.

446
00:19:39,620 --> 00:19:40,100
麦克斯
Max.

447
00:19:40,640 --> 00:19:43,740
小达跟我说了你们的做的事 太有心了
Darius told me what you did and that was awful nice of you.

448
00:19:43,800 --> 00:19:46,260
给 我要还你那些
Now, here. I am reimbursing you

449
00:19:46,260 --> 00:19:49,280
衣服以及那个白痴玩偶的钱
for all of the clothes and for that damn puppet.

450
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:51,420
即使我曾经发过誓 绝不花钱买海狸[逼]
Although I swore I would never pay for beaver.

451
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:55,480
你觉得他会成功吗 厄尔
Do you think he'll ever make it, Earl?

452
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:58,420
现在这年头 谁说的准啊
Who's to say nowadays, Max?

453
00:19:59,080 --> 00:20:00,860
美国达人[有才] 真有咩
America's got talent. Do they?

454
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:06,040
我只知道他是我的孩子 而你特别费心地
All I know is he's my kid, and you went out of your way

455
00:20:06,040 --> 00:20:07,500
努力去帮他
to try and help him.

456
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:09,400
我想你能以儿为傲嘛
Well, I just wanted you to be proud.

457
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:12,800
麦克斯 我十分以你为傲
I am, Max. Very proud.

458
00:20:17,060 --> 00:20:18,540
我跟信用卡公司通了电话
I just talked to VISA.

459
00:20:18,800 --> 00:20:21,440
他们可能挺后悔预先核准了我们的卡
I think they were disappointed they had pre-approved us.

460
00:20:24,560 --> 00:20:26,800
我剪卡了 不剪不行啊
Look, I killed it. I had to.

461
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:28,300
它在引诱我去买台哈雷摩托车
It was telling me to buy a Harley.

462
00:20:29,680 --> 00:20:31,220
开诚布公地说
Okay, open dialogue.

463
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:33,880
我昨天用信用卡又买了件东西
I used the credit card for one more thing yesterday.

464
00:20:34,420 --> 00:20:35,980
开诚布公地说 我也是
Open dialogue. So did I.

465
00:20:37,020 --> 00:20:39,380
这是平价商店里 最好的口红了
It's the fanciest lipstick Payless had.

466
00:20:40,580 --> 00:20:41,660
给
And here.

467
00:20:42,480 --> 00:20:43,940
麦克斯 袋子里不会是蜥蜴吧
Max, are there lizards in that bag?

468
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:45,660
我倒希望
I wish.

469
00:20:48,780 --> 00:20:51,820
跟新的一样 还没有蝴蝶结
They're as good as new and no bows.

470
00:20:52,280 --> 00:20:53,980
麦克斯 你上哪找的补鞋匠
Max, where'd you find a cobbler?

471
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:55,560
这年头哪有补鞋匠
A cobbler?

472
00:20:56,800 --> 00:20:58,580
我是坐了时光机回过去
I took a time machine.

473
00:20:59,300 --> 00:21:00,820
本该去宰了希特勒的
I was supposed to kill Hitler,

474
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:02,280
但想到你的鞋子更重要就没去了
but I thought your shoes were more important.

475
00:21:03,800 --> 00:21:05,040
来 剪了你的卡吧
Okay, let's cut up your card.

476
00:21:05,340 --> 00:21:07,240
还是得留着一张 以防生意急需吧
We should keep one for business emergencies.

477
00:21:07,540 --> 00:21:08,820
放到一个我们永远也不会
We just have to have to put it someplace where

478
00:21:08,820 --> 00:21:10,660
想去碰的地方就行了
we'll never be tempted to reach for it.

479
00:21:11,100 --> 00:21:12,440
奥列格 能把这个收你裤裆里吗
Oleg, would you put this down your pants?

480
00:21:12,940 --> 00:21:13,680
没问题
No problem.
